License Compatibility Note
───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
This component was written independently using the MAX17055 datasheet,
MAX17055 User Guide (UG6595), and MAX17055 Software Implementation Guide
(UG6597) as primary sources.

The following open-source implementations were consulted as reference during
development; no code was copied from them:

  • AwotG/Arduino-MAX17055_Driver  (MIT License)
    https://github.com/AwotG/Arduino-MAX17055_Driver

  • ThingPulse/MAX17055-fuel-gauge  (MIT License)
    https://github.com/ThingPulse/MAX17055-fuel-gauge

  • electricimp/MAX17055  (MIT License)
    https://github.com/electricimp/MAX17055

All referenced libraries are MIT-licensed.  No GPL-licensed code was
incorporated; MIT license compatibility is maintained.
